§ `Schedule 7: Welfare Reform Act 2009 section 32 (contracting out)`

DECLARE `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2) function` IS ONE OF
    `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2)(a) any function under section 8 (attendance etc)`
    `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2)(b) any function under section 9 or 10 in relation to a claimant commitment`
    `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2)(e) functions under section 19 or 19A`
    `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2) some other function`

-- src:3216 | (1) Section 32 (contracting out) is amended as follows.
-- src:3217 | (2) In subsection (2), in section 20E inserted into the Jobseekers Act 1995—
-- src:3218 | (a) for subsection (2)(a) and (b) there is substituted—
-- src:3219 | (a) any function under section 8 (attendance etc);
-- src:3220 | (b) any function under section 9 or 10 in relation to a claimant commitment;
-- src:3221 | (b) after subsection (2)(d) there is inserted—
-- src:3222 | (e) functions under section 19 or 19A;
@ref Sch 7 WRA2009 32(2) inserting JSA 20E(2) (src:3216-3222)
GIVEN `the item` IS A `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2) function`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2) the function is among those listed` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the item`
    WHEN `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2)(a) any function under section 8 (attendance etc)` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2)(b) any function under section 9 or 10 in relation to a claimant commitment` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2)(e) functions under section 19 or 19A` THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the substituted and inserted paragraphs name three kinds of function; paragraphs (c) and (d) are not among the sources, and the subsection's lead-in is not either
    WHEN `Sch 7 WRA2009 20E(2) some other function` THEN NOTHING

