§ `Schedule 8: Social Security Administration Act 1992 Schedule 4 Part 1 (former officers)`

DECLARE `Sch 8 SSAA Sch 4 entry` IS ONE OF
    `Sch 8 SSAA Sch 4 the social fund Commissioner`
    `Sch 8 SSAA Sch 4 a social fund inspector`
    `Sch 8 SSAA Sch 4 a member of any staff employed in connection with the social fund`
    `Sch 8 SSAA Sch 4 some other person`

